      "link": "https://www.theguardian.com/world/2026/nov/15/czechia-protest-prague-media-freedom",
      "description": "<p>Estimated 350,000 people rally against plan to scrap licence fees and fund broadcasters from state budget</p><p>Hundreds of thousands of Czechs are rallying in Prague to protest against what they say is a government attempt to stifle media freedom.</p><p>The gathering on Sunday to save the mandatory licence fees that fund Czechia’s public broadcasters could be one of the biggest in the country’s history, organisers said.</p> <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/world/2026/nov/15/czechia-protest-prague-media-freedom\">Continue reading...</a>",
